```csharp
public static class GNTransAMUnit
{
    public static double AccelerationMultiplier(IEnumerable<DriveState> drives)
    {
        return drives.Any(d => d.Running && d.TA && d.Definition.TransAM) ? 3.0 : 1.0;
    }
}
```
Inactive TA drives are ignored because the multiplier requires `Running && TA && Definition.TransAM` to be true.
